{{!
    @template core_course/category_actionbar

    Displays the tertiary nav for the category page, overridden by Dimensions.

    Modification compared to the original template:
    * The category selector is removed. Core builds it from make_categories_list(), which names
      every category on the site with no capability required, so on a platform where a category
      may be unlisted the selector hands out the whole tree in one control. Removing it here
      rather than in the renderer is what keeps the rest of core's action bar - the search box
      and the additional options - working against two upstreams; the alternative was a copy of
      Boost Union's course_category() to re-diff on every release. The context key the block
      read is left in the example below, unused, so the diff against core stays readable.
    * The example context gives additionaloptions the string the action bar really exports - a
      rendered action menu, or the empty string (see
      \core_course\output\category_action_bar::export_for_template()).
      Core's own example declares an object there, which the template then triple stashes:
      rendering it is a fatal "Object of class stdClass could not be converted to string", and the
      plugin CI's mustache lint renders the example of every template the plugin ships, while it
      never lints core's own copy. Do not copy the object back.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * search Object - The core/search_input context of the search box
    * additionaloptions String - The rendered action menu HTML, or the empty string

    Example context (json):
    {
        "categoryselect" : {
            "formid": "url_select_f61834256d7754158",
            "classes": "urlselect",
            "label": "",
            "disabled": false,
            "title":null,
            "id":"url_select61834256d7754159",
            "sesskey":"LWILINyZMH",
            "action":"http:\/\/localhost\/stable_master\/course\/jumpto.php",
            "showbutton":null,
            "options": [
                {
                    "name":"Category 1",
                    "value":"\/course\/index.php\/?categoryid=279"
                },
                {
                    "name":"Category 2",
                    "value":"\/course\/index.php\/?categoryid=280"
                },
                {
                    "name":"Category 3",
                    "value":"\/course\/index.php\/?categoryid=281"
                }
            ],
            "labelattributes":[],
            "helpicon":false,
            "attributes":[]
        },
        "search": {
            "action": "https://moodle.local/admin/search.php",
            "extraclasses": "my-2",
            "inputname": "search",
            "inform": false,
            "searchstring": "Search settings",
            "value": "policy",
            "btnclass": "primary",
            "query": "themedesigner",
            "hiddenfields": [
                {
                    "name": "context",
                    "value": "11"
                }
            ]
        },
        "additionaloptions": "<div class=\"action-menu\"><a href=\"\/course\/edit.php?category=281\">Action 1<\/a><\/div>"
    }
}}
<div class="container-fluid tertiary-navigation" id="action_bar">
    <div class="d-flex">
        {{#search}}
            <div class="navitem">
                {{> core/search_input }}
            </div>
        {{/search}}
        {{{additionaloptions}}}
    </div>
</div>
